  "description": "Speed means nothing if you can’t use it. The all-new BMC Speedmachine 01 TWO takes everything you know about triathlon bikes and places the most crucial element at the center – you. Of course, the countless hours in wind tunnels, feedback from some of the fastest cyclists in the world, and technical collaboration with our partners at Red Bull Advanced Technologies were vitally important. But a bike that performs well on paper doesn’t mean anything if the rider can’t actually use it. Finished off with the SRAM Force eTap AXS Groupset and powermeter as well as the DT Swiss ARC 1650 Wheelset with Pirelli P-Zero Race 26mm tires.",
